[A.]
<h2>Fun with flyers</h2>
<i>~I"When a workshop is destroyed is will seem that your arm is being hacked from your body. When a bridge falls down through the clouds and into the abyss, you will feel that you are falling with it."<br>
--The Book of Nimbus</i>
<p>~. Following your recent vicotry, you are being posted ever more dangerous missions. You have been dropped behind enemy lines on a commando mission. The sentries have been drugged, and you must quickly capture the enemy priest, so that we may torture him for battle secrets. Good luck.


